{"id":4754,"date":"2016-06-13T14:02:38","date_gmt":"2016-06-13T14:02:38","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/www.myjammindjs.com\/?page_id=4754"},"modified":"2026-06-04T18:51:58","modified_gmt":"2026-06-04T18:51:58","slug":"school-dance-pictures-videos","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/school-dance-pictures-videos\/","title":{"rendered":"Pictures \/ Videos"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2>School Dance Pictures &amp; Videos<\/h2>\n<p>School dance pictures and videos help show the energy, lighting, music, and student engagement that JAMMIN\u2019 DJs brings to proms, homecomings, winter formals, pep rallies, family nights, and special school events. We are always adding new media, so you can also find JAMMIN\u2019 DJs on YouTube, Instagram, Facebook, and other social platforms for our latest event content.<\/p>\n<h3>Prom, Homecoming &amp; School Event Entertainment<\/h3>\n<p>Whether you are planning a formal prom, a high-energy homecoming, a winter formal, or a student celebration, JAMMIN\u2019 DJs can help create the right experience. Our school dance DJs bring professional sound, clean music, lighting, MC support, and event production options that help students stay engaged from the first song to the final send-off.<\/p>\n<p>In addition, our team can adjust the music, lighting, and event flow to match the style of your school. Some events need a polished formal feel, while others need a packed dance floor, big lighting moments, photo booth options, or high-energy production.<\/p>\n<h3>Any Occasion, Any Music, Anywhere, Anytime<\/h3>\n<p>JAMMIN\u2019 DJs provides entertainment for many types of events, including school dances, wedding receptions, corporate events, banquets, proms, reunions, tailgates, graduations, Bar and Bat Mitzvahs, fundraisers, barbecues, holiday parties, and private celebrations.<\/p>\n<p>Because every event is different, we work to match the entertainment style to the crowd, venue, timeline, and overall goal of the event. That means your school dance, prom, or student event can feel fun, organized, age-appropriate, and memorable.<\/p>\n<h3>You Call It, We\u2019ll Help Make It Happen<\/h3>\n<p>Our DJs are professional, experienced, and receptive to your input. We are happy to help with special themes, school traditions, announcements, clean music requests, student engagement, lighting, and even karaoke-style moments when they fit the event.<\/p>\n<p>JAMMIN\u2019 DJs will do whatever it takes to help make each show a success. If you have questions, need ideas, or want help planning the right entertainment package, you are invited to request a quote or contact our team.<\/p>\n<h3>See JAMMIN\u2019 DJs in Action<\/h3>\n<p>Browse the school dance pictures and videos on this page to see real examples of JAMMIN\u2019 DJs entertainment, lighting, dance floor energy, and event production. These moments can help your school picture what is possible for your next prom, homecoming, pep rally, or student celebration.<\/p>\n<p><a class=\"greyButton\" href=\"http:\/\/www.myjammindjs.djintelligence.com\/quote\/index.asp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Get a School Event Quote<\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>School Dance Pictures &amp; Videos School dance pictures and videos help show the energy, lighting, music, and student engagement that JAMMIN\u2019 DJs brings to proms, homecomings, winter formals, pep rallies, family nights, and special school events. We are always adding new media, so you can also find JAMMIN\u2019 DJs on YouTube, Instagram, Facebook, and other&hellip;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-4754","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v26.7 (Yoast SEO v26.7) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<tit